{"id":"1ff1b9c370bbaad1","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-j-separated-objects.md","title":"Definition — j-分离对象","display":"Definition — j-分离对象","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-j-separated-objects","aliases":["14-df-j-separated-objects"],"display":"Definition — j-分离对象","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-j-separated-objects"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-j-separated-objects</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — j-分离对象"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce0c3e433ca617db\" href=\"?note=ce0c3e433ca617db\" title=\"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism\">14-df-j-dense-monomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a> 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、分类子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\top)\">\\((\\Omega,\\top)\\)</span> 与有限极限。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 为 LT 拓扑，稠密单射见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ce0c3e433ca617db\" href=\"?note=ce0c3e433ca617db\" title=\"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism\">14-df-j-dense-monomorphism</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl((\\operatorname{IsMono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\land\\mathrm{IsJDense}(m,j))\\Rightarrow\\forall g,h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,X)\\ (g\\circ m=h\\circ m\\Rightarrow g=h)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl((\\operatorname{IsMono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\land\\mathrm{IsJDense}(m,j))\\Rightarrow\\forall g,h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,X)\\ (g\\circ m=h\\circ m\\Rightarrow g=h)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 V.2：分离只要求稠密延拓的唯一性，不要求存在。该定义使“层=分离+存在”可逐项检验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology","status":"resolved","id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"ce0c3e433ca617db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-elementary-topos]] 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 $1$、分类子 $(\\Omega,\\top)$ 与有限极限。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"ce0c3e433ca617db","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$j$ 为 LT 拓扑，稠密单射见 [[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]；$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl((\\operatorname{IsMono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\land\\mathrm{IsJDense}(m,j))\\Rightarrow\\forall g,h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,X)\\ (g\\circ m=h\\circ m\\Rightarrow g=h)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1123,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-j-separated-objects|Definition — j-分离对象]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-j-separated-objects|Definition — j-分离对象]]"},{"id":"59d5dc773385bba2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)$ 分别采用 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]、[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]] 的精确签名。"},{"id":"d179a7fa180f99f9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,j$ 为初等拓扑斯与 LT 拓扑，$X$ 为对象。积和配对见 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]。$\\Delta_X,\\delta_X$ 及 $G(f)$ 在下式定义；$\\chi_U$ 是子对象 $U$ 的特征箭头。$f:B\\to X$ 的图像作为 $B\\times X$ 的子对象解释；$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}$ 与 $\\mathrm{IsJClosed}$ 分别使用 [[14-df-j-separated-objects]]、[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]]。"},{"id":"5f5d7ce8b2ae609a","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$ 采用 [[14-df-j-separated-objects]]；$\\mathrm{IsIso}(u)$ 采用 [[14-df-isomorphism]]，表示该环境范畴中的双侧逆箭头存在。"},{"id":"24d8686d42636bb7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,j,X$ 满足 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]] 的结构声明；分离性见 [[14-df-j-separated-objects]]。"},{"id":"a169ef2f5263224b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$ 分别采用 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]；$\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)$ 采用 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]，不以未指定的极限对象代替极限锥。"}],"outgoing":["4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","4b8f9443a0ee72c6","ce0c3e433ca617db"]}